      <p>House hacking is one of the most proven paths to owning an Airbnb property with minimal money down. The concept is simple: purchase a multi-unit property using an owner-occupied loan (which requires as little as 3.5% down with an FHA loan), live in one unit, and rent the other units as short-term rentals.</p>
