      <p>Update your listing regularly to signal to the algorithm that your property is actively managed. Refresh your photos seasonally, update your description to reflect any new amenities or improvements, and adjust your amenity checkboxes as you add new features. Listings that are updated frequently tend to receive a small but meaningful boost in search rankings compared to stale listings that have not been modified in months.</p>
