      <p>Follow a room-by-room staging approach. In bedrooms, invest in high-quality white bedding with textured throws and decorative pillows that create a hotel-luxe feel. In living rooms, arrange furniture to create a cozy conversation area centered on the focal point (fireplace, TV, or view). In kitchens, display attractive cookware, a quality coffee station, and fresh items like a fruit bowl. In bathrooms, roll white towels, add quality bath products, and include a small plant or candle for a spa-like touch.</p>
