      <p>Short-term rental businesses generate a unique pattern of income and expenses that standard accounting software often struggles to handle. Multiple revenue streams from different booking platforms, frequent cleaning and turnover expenses, seasonal income variations, and complex depreciation schedules all require an accounting approach tailored to the STR business model. Using generic accounting tools without proper configuration leads to missed deductions, inaccurate reporting, and potential tax compliance issues.</p>
