      <p>Accounting software captures the data, but tax strategy determines how effectively that data translates into tax savings. STR properties offer significant tax advantages including depreciation deductions, cost segregation opportunities, and the potential to offset active income with rental losses under certain qualification criteria. Maximizing these benefits requires both accurate bookkeeping and strategic tax planning.</p>
