      <p>The challenge in Nashville is regulatory compliance. The city has tightened its STR permitting over the years, and investors must navigate the permit process carefully. Properties with existing non-owner-occupied permits command significant premiums because new permits are limited in certain areas. Working with experienced local professionals is essential for navigating Nashville's regulatory landscape.</p>

