      <p>Consider the opportunity cost of your time. If you earn $75 per hour in your primary career and spend 15 hours per week on STR management, that is $1,125 per week in opportunity cost. Even if you cannot convert those hours directly into additional income, the time has value for personal well-being, family, and pursuing other investment opportunities. <a href="https://bnbaccelerator.com">BnB Accelerator</a> positions its management fee as an investment in your time and peace of mind, not an expense.</p>
