    metaDescription: "Compare LLC vs sole proprietorship for STR investing. Analyze liability protection, tax implications, and operational complexity.",
    excerpt: "Should you hold your Airbnb in an LLC or operate as a sole proprietor? We compare liability protection, tax treatment, and setup complexity for both entity structures.",
    publishDate: "2026-06-27",
